# Counter-example for math:ChainShape (derived from the min-1 qualified restriction on
# math:Chain's math:chainOf): a math:Chain naming no math:ChainComplex it is a graded
# element of. Validation MUST emit shacl.MinCountConstraintComponent (math:UngroundedChain).
@prefix math: <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/math/> .
@prefix ex:   <http://example.org/math/> .

ex:bareChain a math:Chain .
